Sat Sep 26 12:41:30 2026 :: ANNOUNCE: Update going in shortly. Here is what changes:
Sat Sep 26 12:41:33 2026 :: ANNOUNCE: 1) Directions on the website can be copied with one button, and there is a Mudlet mode that separates commands with double semicolons so they paste and run correctly.
Sat Sep 26 12:41:36 2026 :: ANNOUNCE: 2) Areas are now listed by their own name with the builder in brackets, so the list reads and sorts by destination instead of by builder.
Sat Sep 26 12:41:39 2026 :: ANNOUNCE: 3) You will be told at login when you have unread notes.
Sat Sep 26 12:41:42 2026 :: ANNOUNCE: 4) Staff are told when bug, typo and idea reports come in, and can now read them in game. Reports you file will actually be seen.
Sat Sep 26 12:41:45 2026 :: ANNOUNCE: The game will save everyone and reboot in a few minutes. It should be back within about a minute of going down.
